id: F23
target: src/sello/field.nim
desc: feSqrtRatioM1: correction-select condition inverted, 'feCMove(r, rPrime, flippedSignSqrt or flippedSignSqrtI)' -> 'feCMove(r, rPrime, not (flippedSignSqrt or flippedSignSqrtI))' -- selects the SQRT_M1-corrected candidate exactly when the ORIGINAL candidate already checked out (correctSignSqrt), and keeps the uncorrected candidate exactly when a correction was actually needed. Replaces the retired F21 (its OLD target, field.feSqrtRatioVartime, was deleted by RFC-004 slice 1c) against the CT primitive's own defect class: which candidate feCMove selects on wasSquare.
====OLD====
  feCMove(r, rPrime, flippedSignSqrt or flippedSignSqrtI)
====NEW====
  feCMove(r, rPrime, not (flippedSignSqrt or flippedSignSqrtI))
====END====
